  "title": "Bad news at Garsa's Sanctuary",
  "description": "Under the advisement of mayor Mok Shaiz, Boba Fett and Fennec Shand return to Garsa's Sanctuary. There, Garsa greets them as courteously as possible. When Fett demands to know what is going on, the Twi'lek proprietor nervously informs him that the Twins, cousins of the late Jabba the Hutt, have laid a claim to the territories of their departed relative. Moments later, the sound of steady rhythmic thumping draws the attention of everyone in the establishment, and piques Fett's curiosity."
